      "duration_ms": 66885,
      "summary": "The team locked scope for the upcoming two‑week sprint, prioritized the calendar sync bug, assigned Jordan to fix it, planned to hand off onboarding checklist specs, decided to defer dark‑mode work, agreed to add a sync‑failure alert, and noted a risk that marketing copy for the checklist is pending.",
      "decisions": [
        "Lock scope for the next two weeks sprint",
        "Push dark mode work to next sprint"
      ],
      "error": null,
      "audio_mime": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 6000,
          "text": "Morning everyone. The goal today is to lock the scope for the next two weeks sprint."
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start_ms": 6000,
          "end_ms": 14000,
          "text": "The calendar sync bug is still our top issue. Customers see duplicate events after they reconnect Google Calendar."
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start_ms": 14000,
          "end_ms": 19000,
          "text": "Then that goes first. Jordan, can you own the fix?"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start_ms": 20000,
          "end_ms": 25000,
          "text": "Yes, I will have a fix ready for review by Wednesday."
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start_ms": 25000,
          "end_ms": 27420,
          "text": "The new onboarding checklist designs are done."
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start_ms": 27420,
          "end_ms": 30160,
          "text": "I can hand off the final specs tomorrow."
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start_ms": 30160,
          "end_ms": 31640,
          "text": "Great."
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start_ms": 31640,
          "end_ms": 37960,
          "text": "We decided to push the dark mode work to next sprint, because the sink bug matters more."
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start_ms": 37960,
          "end_ms": 39320,
          "text": "Agreed."
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start_ms": 39320,
          "end_ms": 46320,
          "text": "I also want to make a difference between the two."
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start_ms": 40000,
          "end_ms": 44800,
          "text": "to add an alert when sync failures spike, so we catch this earlier next time."
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start_ms": 46080,
          "end_ms": 52160,
          "text": "Good idea, take that as well. I will update the roadmap and tell support about the timeline"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start_ms": 52160,
          "end_ms": 58000,
          "text": "today. One risk. The checklist needs copy from marketing, and they have not sent it yet."
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start_ms": 58000,
          "end_ms": 60000,
          "text": "I will ask Marc to"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start_ms": 60000,
          "end_ms": 62000,
          "text": "marketing for the copy by Thursday."
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start_ms": 62000,
          "end_ms": 65000,
          "text": "Okay, that is the plan."
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start_ms": 65000,
          "end_ms": 66000,
          "text": "Thanks all."
        }
      ],
